    old "The cage shook, rattled. The figures made grunted noises, almost like a scuffle."
    new "La gabbia tremò, scricchiolando. Le figure emisero suoni gutturali, quasi come in uno scontro."

    old "One figure was on hands and knees, the other larger one, behind it."
    new "Una figura era in ginocchio, l'altra, più grande, dietro di essa."

    old "Only when her eyes accustomed to the dark further did she fully realize what she was seeing."
    new "Solo quando i suoi occhi si abituarono all'oscurità più profonda, lei capì appieno ciò che stava vedendo."

    old "Nick, down on his hands and knees, was being taken by an orc from behind."
    new "Nick, inginocchiato a quattro zampe, veniva afferrato da dietro da un orco."

    old "So impossible was the sight to her that Sarah could hardly process it, even as she looked on."
    new "Il vedere era così impossibile per lei che Sarah faticava persino a elaborarlo, mentre continuava a guardare."

    old "Agh...Ugh.."
