    old "As much as she blamed Nick for what had happened to them, she could not deny that with some distant hope, she thought he might save her."
    new "Per quanto incolpasse Nick per ciò che era accaduto loro, non poteva negare che, con una vaga speranza, pensasse che lui potesse salvarla."

