    old "She could hear the groaning and heavy breathing of the orc's appreciation."
    new "Poteva sentire i gemiti e il respiro pesante dell'orco, segno del suo piacere."

    old "Still, no matter how much she submitted to him, he was still rough with her."
    new "Tuttavia, per quanto lei si sottomettesse a lui, lui era ancora rude con lei."

